### Get User Notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Mark Notification Read
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Notification Preference
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "type": "CAMPAIGN_FINISHED",
  "enabled": true
}

### Get Notification Settings (Admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Notification Settings (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "channels": [
    {
      "channel": "EMAIL",
      "target": "admin@example.com",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "channel": "TELEGRAM",
      "target": "-1001234567890",
      "enabled": true
    }
  ],
  "matrix": [
    {
      "type": "CAMPAIGN_FINISHED",
      "channel": "EMAIL",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "type": "ERROR_OCCURRED",
      "channel": "TELEGRAM",
      "enabled": true
    }
  ]
}
